<title>HONG KONG: Pearl sells property in HK's Wanchai.</title>
<headline>Pearl sells property in HK's Wanchai.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pearl Oriental Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it sold office space in Hong Kong's central Wanchai district to independent consortia for a total of HK$295.52 million.</p>
<p>Pearl Oriental said in a statement that total floor space sold was 22,164 square feet in three separate floors of 7,388 square feet each at Pearl Oriental Centre.</p>
<p>It did not name the buyers.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
